        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports feeling 'a bit feverish' for 3 days, with fluctuating low-grade fevers mainly in the evenings. Thinks temperature may have reached about 38 °C; checked once yesterday and recorded 37.8 °C on a home thermometer."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
