        "code": {
          "text": "Appetite and oral intake"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Appetite slightly decreased; still eating solids and drinking fluids."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Pertinent reported negatives with current febrile illness"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies shortness of breath, pleuritic chest pain, chest tightness, wheeze, rigors, confusion, dysphagia, sinus pain, otalgia, dysuria, urinary frequency, flank pain, nausea, vomiting, diarrhea, abdominal pain, rash, severe headache, photophobia, neck stiffness, and focal neurologic symptoms."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right heel pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Anteromedial right heel pain, worst with the first steps in the morning and after sitting; described as 'like stepping on a stone'. It eases as the day goes on and returns after long shifts on her feet. Ongoing; reports soreness at the end of the day and difficulty walking first thing and after work breaks."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Pertinent reported negatives with right heel pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies trauma, numbness, weakness, and night pain waking her from sleep."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-15",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-15",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance and respiratory effort"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Alert and orientated, mildly tired appearing, not toxic, speaking in full sentences, and in no respiratory distress."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-16",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-16",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Eye, ear, throat, and neck examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Conjunctiva clear. Tympanic membranes normal bilaterally. Mild diffuse pharyngeal erythema; no exudate or tonsillar swelling; uvula midline; no trismus. Neck supple; no cervical lymphadenopathy."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-17",
