        },
        "valueString": "Denies chronic cough, exertional shortness of breath, exertional chest pain, palpitations, syncope, focal weakness, speech disturbance, seizures, other joint swelling, inflammatory back pain, and volunteered depressive symptoms. Reports mood is okay."
      }
